{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SQUASER 7\u00a0\u00a0</strong>is a unique minimalist puzzle game where your mission is to wipe away all traces of darkness. Control a white square in a world of black, white, and gray tones, clearing your path through dark labyrinths. Each level brings new challenges, demanding greater logic, memory, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in this world of stark contrasts, planning each move carefully as you erase every bit of darkness to leave each level pristine. Progress from a beginner to a true <i>erasure expert</i>, achieving perfection on every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the mouse and the keyboard (WASD or arrow keys) to navigate through the different mazes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>SQUASER 7</strong>:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25aa\ufe0f 50 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25aa\ufe0f Minimalist art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25aa\ufe0f Simple controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25aa\ufe0f Calm, relaxing music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25aa\ufe0f Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625890/extras/1.png?t=1743243082\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625890/extras/2.png?t=1743243082\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625890/extras/3.png?t=1743243082\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625890/extras/4.png?t=1743243082\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625890/extras/1.png?t=1743243082\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625890/extras/2.png?t=1743243082\" /><im